 me?3. What percentage of the total amount in question Willie good for you after the money is in your control while I come over and finalize my education? Please, Consider this and get back to me as soon as possible Immediately I confirmed you willingness then will send to you my picture. And I will need your own pictures as well.  Yours Sincerely, Joseph - Joseph Kansas",d10,Insurance,"GENERAL SETTINGS
