Dear Friend, I write to inform you of my desire to acquire estates or landed properties in your country on behalf of director of Contracts and Finance Allocation of the Federal Ministry of works and Housing in Nigeria. Considering his very strategic and influential position, he would want the transaction to be strictly as confidential as possible. He further wants his identity to remain undisclosed at least for now, until the completion of the transaction. Hence, our desire Mohave an overseas agent. I have therefore been directed to inquire if you would agree to act as our overseas agent in order actualize this transaction. The deal in brief is that the funds with which to carry out our proposed investments in your country is presently in a coded account in the Nigerian apex bank, and we need your assistance to transfer the funds to your country Oran safe account outside your country in a convenient bank account that will be provided by you before pecan put the funds into use. For this you shall reconsidered to have executed a contract for the ministry. The contract sum of which shall run intoUS$15.5Million of which your share shall be 30% if you agree to be our overseas agent. Your area specialization does not matter in this transaction, all that is required of you is a safe account and your willingness to assist us acquire estates in your country. As soon as payment is effected and the amount mentioned above is successfully transferred into your account, we intend to use our own share in acquiring some estates abroad. For this too, you shall serve sour agent. It might interest you to note that last year, a similar transaction was carried out with ONEM. CHECHEN YOU of Taiwan but after securing the payment approvals, and payment effected, MR.CHIENCHENYU changed his numbers and addresses, and was no whereto be found on our getting to Taiwan. That was how we lost US$7.5Million. So this time around, I will be with you before transmittance is made into your provided account to avoid future occurrence and allow trust to play a very minimal role until performance is seen. You are requested to communicate your acceptance or otherwise of this proposal, through my email. After which we shall discuss in details the modalities for seeing this transaction through. If however, you are not disposed to assist, kindly destroy this lettering view of the confidentiality of the proposed transaction and interest of personalities involved. Thank you in anticipation of your co-operation. Best Regards, Dr. Mohammed Azeem.",d13,Social Media and Online Communities,"GENERAL SETTINGS
